# Scenario S4 typing-demo (creative): type a prompt into the omp TUI, do not send, quit. Header injected.
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 120ms
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "omp --no-session"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
Type "explain what this repository does"
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
